OL,3,GNEWSADetective who socialised during
OL,4,Aoperation sacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA detective constable who socialised
OL,7,Fwith a colleague while on a
OL,8,Fsurveillance operation "targeting
OL,9,Fserious and organised criminality" has
OL,10,Fbeen sacked.
OL,12,FMatthew Roberts, of Thames Valley
OL,13,FPolice, misused a police van, failed to
OL,14,Ffollow instructions, socialised while
OL,15,Fon duty and was subsequently untruthful
OL,16,Fin his accounts, a misconduct panel
OL,17,Ffound.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
