OL,3,GNEWSADetective who socialised during
OL,4,Aoperation sacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe panel said his actions during an
OL,7,Foperation targeting human trafficking
OL,8,Fand modern slavery "had the potential
OL,9,Fto undermine the investigative
OL,10,Fobjectives and evidence collection" and
OL,11,Fcould have left vulnerable victims at
OL,12,Ffurther risk.
OL,14,FAll allegations were proved and the
OL,15,Fpanel concluded they amounted to gross
OL,16,Fmisconduct.
